  ],
  "description": "SY AINI is a brand-new 2025 YYachts Y7, an exceptional 23.6-metre luxury performance sailing yacht that combines Scandinavian elegance with world-class sailing capabilities. Designed by renowned naval architect Bill Tripp and built by Michael Schmidt Yachtbau, AINI offers a rare balance of exhilarating sailing performance, luxurious comfort and effortless handling, making her one of the most distinctive crewed sailing yachts available on the French Riviera.\n\nBased in Antibes, AINI is perfectly positioned for bespoke charters along the French Riviera, Monaco, Saint-Tropez, Corsica and Northern Sardinia. Unlike many yachts of her size, she is designed to truly sail, delivering a quiet, authentic and engaging experience even in light winds, while offering spacious outdoor living areas and beautifully crafted contemporary interiors.\n\nComplemented by an outstanding professional crew, guests can expect exceptional hospitality, personalised itineraries and outstanding Mediterranean cuisine, whether enjoying a relaxing family holiday, a romantic escape or an unforgettable sailing adventure through some of Europe's most spectacular cruising grounds. Captain Jannika Lindbohm brings extensive international sailing experience and a passion for sharing life at sea, while Chef/Stewardess Laura De Rose delights guests with fresh Mediterranean-inspired cuisine and attentive service throughout the charter.",
